      "label": "b",
      "kind": "working_line",
      "text": "$\\frac{1+\\sin\\theta}{1-2\\sin\\theta-4\\sin^2\\theta}=2\\text{cosec}\\theta\\Rightarrow(1+\\sin\\theta)\\sin\\theta=2(1-2\\sin\\theta-4\\sin^2\\theta)$ M1"
    },
    {
      "question_id": "IAL2018_WMA13_Oct2022_Q9",
      "label": "b",
      "kind": "working_line",
      "text": "$\\Rightarrow9\\sin^2\\theta+5\\sin\\theta-2=0$ A1"
    },
    {
      "question_id": "IAL2018_WMA13_Oct2022_Q9",
      "label": "b",
      "kind": "working_line",
      "text": "$\\Rightarrow\\sin\\theta=\\frac{-5\\pm\\sqrt{25-4\\times9\\times-2}}{18}=\\ldots\\Rightarrow\\theta=\\sin^{-1}\\ldots$ M1"
    },
    {
      "question_id": "IAL2018_WMA13_Oct2022_Q9",
